\fB	    ;	\fPRequest separator
\fB	    !	\fPEscape to shell
.P2
.PP
ADB catches signals, so a user cannot use a quit signal to exit from ADB.
The request $q or $Q (or cntl-D) must be used
to exit from ADB.
.NH
