places on the stack.
Therefore the message "symbol not found".
.PP
Another way of getting at the data in this example is to print
the variables used in the call as:
.P1
	f+4:b	fcnt/d;  f.a/;  f.b/;  f.fi/
	g+4:b	gcnt/d;  g.p/;  g.q/;  g.gi/
	:c
