.ftR
.x2
to produce the text
.x1
.ftB
Today is Monday the 14th.
.ftR
.x2
Note that the \fB\e$\fR
was concealed in the definition with a prepended \fB\e\fR.
The number of currently available
arguments is in the \fB.$\fR register.
