.hh "Keeps"
.fi
Lines bracketed by the following commands are kept together,
and will appear entirely on one page:
.TS
center;
Lf3 5 L8 Lf3 5 L.
\&.KS	not moved	.KF	may float
\&.KE	through text	.KE	in text
