.EQ I (2.2a)
fat {roman  V}  bar sub nu~=~left [ pile {a above b above c}
right ] + al design improvements
and the eradication of bugs.
He also translated the C parse-tables
and
.UC YACC 
parser
into Fortran for the
first
Ratfor
