and the light beam directed by fiber optics
to the desired place on a piece of photogr2␀␀␀-B␀␀*B␀␀'B␀␀$B␀␀!B␀␀B␀␀B␀␀B␀␀B␀␀B␀␀B␀␀B␀␀	B␀␀B␀␀B␀␀␀B␀␀˝A␀␀˙A␀␀˜A␀␀ÙA␀␀ÒA␀␀ÓA␀␀ÎA␀␀ËA␀␀ÂA␀␀‚A␀␀ﬂA␀␀‹A␀␀ŸA␀␀÷A␀␀”A␀␀–A␀␀ÕA␀␀ A␀␀«A␀␀ƒA␀␀¡A␀␀æA␀␀ªA␀␀∏A␀␀µA␀␀≤A␀␀ØA␀␀¨A␀␀©A␀␀¶A␀␀£A␀␀†A␀␀ùA␀␀öA␀␀®c␀␀´c␀␀Æc␀␀±c␀␀¥c␀␀∑c␀␀∫c␀␀Ωc␀␀¿c␀␀√c␀␀∆c␀␀…c␀␀Ãc␀␀œc␀␀“c␀␀’c␀␀ÿc␀␀€c␀␀ﬁc␀␀·c␀␀‰c␀␀Ác␀␀Íc␀␀Ìc␀␀c␀␀Ûc␀␀ˆc␀␀˘c␀␀¸c␀␀ˇc␀␀d␀␀d␀␀d␀␀d␀␀d␀␀d␀␀d␀␀d␀␀d␀␀d␀␀ d␀␀#d␀␀&d␀␀)d␀␀,d␀␀/d␀␀2d␀␀5d␀␀8d␀␀;d␀␀>d␀␀Ad␀␀Dd␀␀Gd␀␀Jd␀␀Md␀␀Pd␀␀Sd␀␀Vd␀␀Yd␀␀\d␀␀_d␀␀bd␀␀ed␀␀hd␀␀kd␀␀nd␀␀qd␀␀td␀␀wd␀␀zd␀␀}d␀␀Äd␀␀Éd␀␀Üd␀␀âd␀␀åd␀␀etc., into .GT., .GE., etc.
